    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driving License? Never heard of it</strong>, is a physics based driving game set in a city where all drivers apparently got their driving licenses out of cereal boxes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 16 different cars, with various types of performance upgrades that can be purchased and installed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with performance upgrades, there are also <i>abilities.</i>\u00a0These abilities help you deal with the absolute insanity that you will find on the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has a story that the player uncovers through characters, and different types of driving and racing events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please give us a whishlist if you think thi could be something you enjoy, It helps a great deal.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you :)</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Driving License? Never heard of it</strong>, is a physics based driving game set in a city where all drivers apparently got their driving licenses out of cereal boxes.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has 16 different cars, with various types of performance upgrades that can be purchased and installed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along with performance upgrades, there are also <i>abilities.</i>\u00a0These abilities help you deal with the absolute insanity that you will find on the streets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also has a story that the player uncovers through characters, and different types of driving and racing events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please give us a whishlist if you think thi could be something you enjoy, It helps a great deal.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you :)</p>",
    "short_description": "Have you ever screamed &quot;WHAT IS THIS CLOWN DOINGGGGG?!&quot; while driving? Well now you can do that in a game. Navigate a city full of drivers with apparent death wishes, use wild abilities to survive the madness, win races, and uncover the plot behind Tri City's vehicular insanity.",
